OL,3,GNEWSACouncil exceeds Surrey tree
OL,4,Aplanting target
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 800,000 new trees have been
OL,7,Fplanted across Surrey over the past
OL,8,Ffive years, exceeding the council's own
OL,9,Ftarget, according to a report.
OL,11,FSurrey County Council's report found
OL,12,F116,359 trees had been planted in the
OL,13,F2025/26 financial year alone.
OL,15,FIt said the total planted between 2021
OL,16,Fand 2026 was around 885,000, surpassing
OL,17,Fits initial target of 600,000.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
