OL,3,GNEWSACouncil exceeds Surrey tree
OL,4,Aplanting target
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Elmbridge Borough Council
OL,7,Frecently passed a motion calling for
OL,8,Fthe future East Surrey council to
OL,9,Fupdate its tree strategy to consider
OL,10,Fsurvival rates.
